From 3e5ac6bca0f758e0f0ed65ecb6872d4a6ed317ee Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>
Date: Thu, 3 Sep 2026 18:33:18 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat: in-app OTA updates via PackageInstaller

Sideloaded builds now download and install their own updates instead of
sending volunteers to a browser download page. The published manifest
carries a SHA-256 the app verifies before committing an install session,
and updates between the minimum and latest build show a dismissible
prompt rather than a hard block.
